WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.770
The first match of the semi-finals in Holy Road's Kanto block district preliminaries!

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:16.660
The game between Raimon and Teikoku Academy moves abruptly into Teikoku's favor!

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.580
Raimon fights with only ten players!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.880
Blockaded by Teikoku's hardy defense, they're forced into a tough game.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:28.670
In this match where two famous schools clash, there's no telling what developments we can expect!

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.050
Kurama!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:33.800
There it is!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:37.980
Good one!

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.700
Make it in!

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:44.850
What? Damn it!

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.070
This is Teikoku Academy's defense!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.910
The ball goes to Teikoku's captain Mikado!

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:04.710
Begin the attack!

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:05.870
Right!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.470
Why?

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:20.260
Why aren't you in the match, Kyousuke?

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.030
Stop them!

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.370
Raimon's defense moves speedily to mark them!

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.040
But Sasaki is unmarked!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.140
Mikado uses this chance to make a quick pass!

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:13.830
Oh no!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.480
Dribbling, Sasaki approaches the goal!

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.760
With only ten people, Raimon's defense is stretching themselves out thin!

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:28.470
I won't let you!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:32.380
Amazing! Matsukaze comes back all the way to defend!

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.180
He's one fast runner!

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:39.710
Tenma!

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.080
I knew he'd come through!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.070
He's like a whirlwind.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.780
No matter what we do, one of them always ends up free.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:49.580
This is tough.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:52.110
We'll have to keep defending to pull through this, I guess.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:52.770
No.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:56.000
Defending won't help us win.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.000
Our opponent is Teikoku Academy.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:03.010
If we want to win... we need Ultimate Thunder!

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:08.950
You still want to use Ultimate Thunder with just the ten of us?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:09.920
Don't be crazy!

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:13.440
We need everyone involved if we want to block Teikoku's attacks!

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.310
We can't afford to chance it.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.280
Then we'll have to compensate our lack of players with more momentum.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:26.090
No matter how small a chance we've got, we'll do Ultimate Thunder as soon as one of us has the ball!

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:26.820
Got it?

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:31.060
But that hissatsu tactics was never perfected.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:32.790
Who's going to make the finishing kick?

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.210
I'll do it!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:37.850
Shindou...

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.470
Guys, don't worry about our goal!

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:42.920
Go!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.380
Okay!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:48.800
All right, I'll keep running and running until I steal the opponent's ball!

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:49.680
Tenma!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:53.880
I've trained so much on my hissatsu technique.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:54.890
I can do it too!

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:59.400
Now, the match resumes with Teikoku's throw-in!

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:06.720
Kyousuke...

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:08.730
Morning, Nii-san.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.170
Kyousuke, what are you doing here?

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.670
What about your game?

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.270
Oh...

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.760
Kyousuke?

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.020
Shindou-kun!

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.020
What?!

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.100
Teikoku's ball has been cut!

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:35.640
Hamano!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:37.980
Shindou!

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.020
Let's do it, guys!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.670
Kurama! Tenma! You two, move up!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.530
Okay!

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.530
Shindou...

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:47.990
Alrighty...

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:50.700
Hayami!

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.490
What's this? Raimon makes a back pass!

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:59.030
They're sending the ball away from the goal! What are they about to do?!

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.660
That formation...

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:04.250
They're about to use Ultimate Thunder!

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:05.710
Hmm...

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.340
Shindou!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.340
Here goes!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:14.060
Ultimate Thunder!

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.780
The ball is still in, grab it!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:28.900
O-Okay!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.670
Matsukaze seizes the ball that bounced back on Shindou!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:32.780
The ball is mine!

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.250
Soyokaze Step!

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:46.670
Matsukaze slips past Asukaji and moves on with dribbling!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.850
I won't let you get any further!

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:49.930
Intercept him!

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.510
Here, Tenma!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.430
Captain!

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.930
Shindou has been moving up as well!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.470
Tenma!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.480
Captain!

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.150
This will do it!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.110
Fortissimo!

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:15.700
No way!

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:19.160
He blocked Shin-sama's shoot!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.560
A-An incredible catch by Teikoku's goalkeeper, Miyabino!

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:25.320
He caught Shindou's hissatsu shoot without even batting an eye!

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:30.300
Shindou Takuto... Is that all you've got?

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:40.310
Teikoku's wall is far higher, thicker, and stronger than you seem to think.

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:44.690
Don't go underestimating Teikoku's soccer.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:50.400
As anticipated, once Shindou is restrained, the entire team is rendered powerless.

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.940
Shake them up.

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:54.550
Yes, sir.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:58.990
All members, Operation Delta Three!

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.120
Roger!

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:15.430
N-Now Teikoku has made a bold move by dividing their players and lining them up on either side!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.680
What are they up to?

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:20.920
Kidou...

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:25.490
Miyabino passes to Ryuuzaki!

00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:27.900
Guys, tighten the defense!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:28.870
Okay!

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:32.860
I have to protect the goal until Ultimate Thunder is ready!

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.780
Ryuuzaki passes to Narita on the opposite side!

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:42.700
This time Narita passes to Sasaki!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:46.240
Teikoku is making long passes on both sides, leaving Raimon floundering!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:47.580
With that, they move up to attack!

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:55.100
Having Shindou up at the front makes him unable to strategize for the lower field,

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.870
forcing them into a one-sided defensive battle.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.060
So this is Raimon's weakpoint.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.110
Itsumi!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:05.060
A high ball! It's a centering for Itsumi!

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:06.440
It's mine!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.600
Itsumi jumps high!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.040
I've practiced this loads before today!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:12.980
I can stop it!

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:15.750
Outta my way!

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:26.490
Itsumi makes a heading, but it lands a few inches outside the goal.

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:29.920
Did the shoot miss due to Nishizono's desperate defense?

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.550
You won't get off easy next time.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:40.520
Shinsuke!

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:42.590
Are you okay?

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:43.370
Yeah...

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.730
How do I stop them?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:10:00.430
Raimon is stuck defending throughout against Teikoku's fierce attacks.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:02.640
Will they continue to be kept back at arm's length?

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:06.370
Or will they be able to find an opening and charge through?

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.190
Hayami!

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:08.670
Kirino-kun!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:09.830
Amagi-san!

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.340
Shindou!

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.920
Ultimate Thunder!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:24.940
What do we do, Shindou?

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.520
Ten people aren't enough to defend against a full team.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.480
Ultimate Thunder isn't working either.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.830
Inazuma Eleven...

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:38.680
GO!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:43.300
Inazuma Eleven...

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.250
GO!

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:53.460
Are you sure you should be here, Kyousuke?

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.930
If you leave now, you can still make it there in time.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:07.640
Kyousuke...

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:08.930
It's fine.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:13.560
Even without me, those guys can fight with just ten.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:21.400
Hey, this room feels kind of hot. I'm thirsty.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.530
I'll go get something to drink.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.920
Kyousuke...

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.090
Now the ball goes to Horasawa!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.570
Teikoku has the opportunity yet again!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.560
Mikado!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:51.520
There!

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:08.090
They've done nothing but attack us for a while now.

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:09.980
It's taking all we can to defend.

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:13.990
If only I could stop the ball...

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.930
Why isn't Coach saying anything anyway?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.130
Doesn't he have any orders for us?

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:27.730
Coach Endou...

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.270
They're pretty thick-skinned, the Raimon team.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.150
We're being too soft.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:37.760
We should be able to pulverize a team like this with a single blow if we rained down on them.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.950
Now is exactly the time for it!

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.980
What is that coach thinking?

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:45.110
Commander has his own ways of thinking.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:49.900
All we must do is act accordingly to Commander's orders,

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:51.830
and play Teikoku Academy's soccer.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:55.370
Don't you go giving me orders, Miyabino.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.920
I'm Teikoku's captain.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:02.590
And I understand Commander Kidou's soccer the best.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.570
It's a hard fight with only ten people.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:12.070
They're up against Teikoku Academy, it's only natural.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.270
Hey...

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:18.810
Was it right for us to have quit?

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:25.890
It's no use asking that now...

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.780
I know, but...

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:33.110
They're strong. So this is Teikoku Academy.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.800
Teikoku Academy's Commander, Kidou Yuuto.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:42.910
The genius playmaker who led Inazuma Japan to the world...

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:45.220
...and who's Coach Endou's best friend.

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:47.970
I can't believe someone like him would be helping Fifth Sector!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:52.760
But since he's fought together with Coach Endou before,

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:56.680
it should bring back memories to him...

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.320
...of what real soccer is.

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:04.170
Raimon manages to clear the ball to avoid Teikoku's attacks...

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.110
...but the danger still continues!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.660
Now Teikoku's Kamata resumes the match with his throw-in!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:12.200
Tenma!

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:13.700
I'll stop him!

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.040
Don't underestimate me!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:19.920
Tenma!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.320
Don't let him forward!

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.170
We know!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.990
Ryuuzaki passes to Mikado!

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.300
Mikado is unmarked!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:29.220
Crap!

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:30.340
Take this!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:37.750
Goalkeeper Sangoku blocks it with a frantic punch!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.610
Shinsuke!

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.110
If I don't stop them, they'll score.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.100
But will I even be able to?

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:57.410
Shinsuke!

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:00.580
The sky!

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:02.900
Don't aim for them!

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.980
Aim for the sky and fly!

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:09.830
I get it!

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:12.550
Okay!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:14.470
Shinsuke!

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:22.310
I got so caught up thinking about how to stop the ball that I couldn't jump properly.

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:25.190
My specialty is jumping...

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.530
The jump that I've been practicing all this time...

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:28.980
It's mine!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:32.360
From all that practice, I should be able to fly even higher than ever!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.070
Full Throttle Jump!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.990
H-He jumped higher than me?!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.040
What?!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:51.220
Nishizono clears the ball with a jump even greater than Itsumi's!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:49.910
I did it!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.430
Shinsuke, nice clear!

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:55.850
Nishizono...

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:59.010
Shinsuke-kun flew!

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:00.830
He's not bad, that guy!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.800
That was amazing, Shinsuke!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:07.650
Shinsuke-kun couldn't jump as high as he did during practice because of his nerves.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.340
And he cleared that away with just a few words.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:20.540
He's trying to make them grow not by giving them the answer but by pointing out the way.

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:23.690
Like Coach Kudou.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.610
I'll definitely get this ball that Shinsuke defended!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:30.590
What?

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:34.840
Everyone, we're hitting back!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:35.590
Okay!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.600
Shindou, use Ultimate Thunder!

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.390
Kurama!

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.920
Nishizono made a drastic effort to defend.

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:50.320
How can I just sit back like this when a first-year is working that hard?

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:53.650
I'll make the final shoot!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:56.890
Kurama...

00:16:57.900 --> 00:16:58.530
Okay!

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:01.310
Forward Kurama runs away from the goal!

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:04.800
Could this be the hissatsu tactics that they've tried earlier?

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:18.590
Why aren't you participating in the match?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.560
Tsurugi Kyousuke.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.060
Hayami!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.800
Kirino-kun!

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:28.520
Amagi-san!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.410
Ultimate Thunder?

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:34.940
Are they thinking of trying it again?

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:40.950
I believe Fifth Sector gave you a mission...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.450
To lead Raimon to defeat.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:46.710
There's no need to worry.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:51.630
Even if I did nothing in this match,

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:53.710
Raimon will lose.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:56.260
Kurama!

00:17:58.350 --> 00:18:01.350
I'll make in Ultimate Thunder!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.180
No matter what you're planning, it's hopeless.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:08.910
Come out, Avatar!

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:11.110
Dragoon Tedis!

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:23.950
H-He brought out an Avatar!

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:25.290
Kurama-senpai!

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:28.330
Ryuuzaki takes back the ball with his Avatar!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.720
Raimon's hissatsu tactics fails once again!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.340
So this is the Raimon of today.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:38.300
Destroy them.

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:41.080
Yes, sir.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:44.850
All members, Operation Alpha One!

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.230
He finally made the order.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.310
Let's go!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.270
Right!

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:56.400
Teikoku Academy tempers their skills with a strict training regime.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.660
There's no chance that Raimon can win with only ten players.

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.570
Let's hope so.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:08.080
But on the off-chance that Raimon <i>does</i>  win and Teikoku is defeated,

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:12.330
you will have to give up on the money for your brother's surgery.

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:30.940
He's fast!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:32.190
You...!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:40.740
You think you can beat us with this lousy defense?

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:43.660
This is Operation Alpha One!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.320
How Teikoku attacks when we really mean it!

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.370
I'll stop you!

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:53.370
Emperor Penguin 7!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:08.350
Burning Catch!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.940
Goal!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:22.450
Mikado's intense shoot breaks through Raimon's goal!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:27.700
In Holy Road's Kanto block district preliminaries semi-finals, Teikoku makes the first point!

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.130
Kidou. This is...

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:42.640
Endou. This is Teikoku's soccer.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:48.270
Not only do they have Avatars, but powerful shoots as well.

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.860
We just have ten players.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:52.770
And Ultimate Thunder still isn't ready yet.

